## Recovery & Stabilization (Current Phase)

### Context
Recent logging changes caused stability issues (crashes). We have reverted those changes and are now stabilizing the application while adding requested media controls.

### Objectives
1.  **Restore Stability**: Ensure no crashes on start/scan.
2.  **Media Toggles**: Add user control to disable Video/RAW loading.
    - [x] C++: [AsyncImageProvider](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/src/AsyncImageProvider.h#36-37) atomic flags.
    - [x] QML: Checkboxes in Footer.
3.  **Visual Overlays**: Indicate "VID" and "RAW" on grid items.
    - [x] C++: [getItemProperty](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/test_scrollbench/src/ScrollBenchImageModel.cpp#612-633) supports "isVideo"/"isRaw".
    - [x] QML: Badges on Image delegate.
4.  **Verification**: Confirm build passes and runtime features work.

